WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.830
- Manhattan District Attorney Cy Vance

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.650
has convened a special grand jury

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.230
to hear evidence about potential charges

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.984
against members of the Trump Organization,

00:00:06.984 --> 00:00:09.110
and potentially the Trump family.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:10.020
Reached for comment,

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.567
the former president said,

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:16.314
"Absolutely everyone says my
juries are the grandest juries

00:00:16.314 --> 00:00:17.147
anyone has ever seen.

00:00:17.147 --> 00:00:18.660
anyone has ever seen.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.644
Big, beautiful juries the likes of which

00:00:21.644 --> 00:00:22.870
Big, beautiful juries the likes of which

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.410
no one has ever seen.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.740
My juries are at least
100 grand, everyone says."

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:30.560
So, what is a grand
jury in the first place?

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:34.170
And is Donald Trump really
in trouble this time or what?

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:35.523
Well, it kinda.

